ties ]</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">[ Tiers ]</a>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- Border Gradient Skill -->\n            <button class=\"relative rounded-sm p-[1px] overflow-hidden group\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-cyan-400 to-blue-600 opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500\" style=\"background-size: 200% auto; animation: gradientMove 3s linear infinite;\"></div>\n                <div class=\"relative bg-[#050914] px-6 py-2 rounded-sm text-xs font-medium text-blue-100 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors duration-300 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    Initialize\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n            </button>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Hero Section -->\n        <main class=\"flex-1 relative flex flex-col justify-center pb-32\">\n\n            <!-- Center 3D AI Head (Simulated with image) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[800px] h-[800px] pointer-events-none flex items-center justify-center opacity-90 mix-blend-screen\" style=\"animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite;\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-blue-500/20 blur-[120px] rounded-full\"></div>\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1707091568384-66f5fb173763?ixid=M3w3NTc5NzN8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwyNnx8YWJzdHJhY3R8ZW58MXwyfHx8MTc3MjY5NzkyNHww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;w=1600&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;q=80\" alt=\"AI Core\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-full mask-image-radial\" style=\"mask-image: radial-gradient(circle, black 40%, transparent 70%); filter: contrast(1.2) saturate(0.8) hue-rotate(190deg);\">\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"relative z-20 flex flex-col lg:flex-row justify-between items-center lg:items-start w-full gap-12 lg:gap-0 mt-12 lg:mt-0\">\n\n                <!-- Left Content -->\n                <div class=\"w-full lg:w-[320px] flex flex-col gap-10 lg:mt-24\">\n                    <h1 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl tracking-tight font-light uppercase leading-[1.1] text-slate-100\">\n                        Architecting<br>Tomorrow With<br>Neural Networks\n                    </h1>\n\n                    <!-- Bracketed Box -->\n                    <div class=\"relative p-5 text-xs font-light text-slate-400 tracking-wide flex flex-col gap-3\">\n                        <!-- Corner Brackets -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-2 h-2 border-t border-l border-slate-600\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-2 h-2 border-t border-r border-slate-600\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-2 h-2 border-b border-l border-slate-600\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-2 h-2 border-b border-r border-slate-600\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Number Details Skill -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors cursor-default\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[10px] text-blue-500 font-medium\">01</span>\n                            <span>NEXT-GEN LANGUAGE MODELS</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors cursor-default\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[10px] text-blue-500 font-medium\">02</span>\n                            <span>DETERMINISTIC OUTPUTS</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors cursor-default\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[10px] text-blue-500 font-medium\">03</span>\n                            <span>INFINITE SCALABILITY</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Right Content -->\n                <div class=\"w-full lg:w-[280px] flex flex-col gap-8 lg:mt-48 items-end text-right\">\n\n                    <!-- Bracketed Box -->\n                    <div class=\"relative p-5 text-xs font-light text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-left\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-2 h-2 border-t border-l border-slate-600\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-2 h-2 border-t border-r border-slate-600\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-2 h-2 border-b border-l border-slate-600\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-2 h-2 border-b border-r border-slate-600\"></div>\n                        Streamlining complex operations, predictive analytics, and autonomous growth are fully realized through our proprietary cognitive engine.\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"text-4xl tracking-tight font-medium text-blue-400\">12,400+</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-light text-slate-500\">Nodes</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Small Card -->\n                    <div class=\"bg-white text-black p-2 w-48 flex flex-col gap-2 shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(59,130,246,0.15)] transform hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-300\">\n                        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-medium px-1 pt-1 flex justify-between items-center\">\n                            Encrypted &amp; Localized\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-check-linear\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"h-24 w-full bg-slate-200 overflow-hidden relative\">\n                            <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1451187580459-43490279c0fa?ixid=M3w3NTc5NzN8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHw4fHxzZXJ2ZXJ8ZW58MXwwfHx8MTc3MjY5Nzk2M3ww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;w=800&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Server\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover filter grayscale opacity-80\" style=\"\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-blue-500/10 mix-blend-overlay\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Huge Text -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full text-center pointer-events-none select-none\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-[12vw] tracking-tighter font-medium leading-none text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-100 via-blue-400 to-blue-900 opacity-90\" style=\"filter: drop-shadow(0 0 40px rgba(59,130,246,0.2));\">\n                    Synthetix\n                </h2>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n\n    <style>\n        @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-10px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }\n        @keyframes float { 0%, 100% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%); } 50% { transform: translate(-50%, -52%); } }\n        @keyframes gradientMove { 0% { background-position: 0% 50%; } 100% { background-position: 200% 50%; } }\n    </style>\n\n    <!-- WebGL Line Animation Simulation -->\n    <script>\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('neural-net');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n        let width, height;\n        let particles = [];\n\n        function resize() {\n            width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n            height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n        }\n\n        class Particle {\n            constructor() {\n                this.x = Math.random() * width;\n                this.y = Math.random() * height;\n                this.vx = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.5;\n                this.vy = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.5;\n                this.radius = Math.random() * 1.5;\n            }\n            update() {\n                this.x += this.vx;\n                this.y += this.vy;\n                if (this.x < 0 || this.x > width) this.vx *= -1;\n                if (this.y < 0 || this.y > height) this.vy *= -1;\n            }\n            draw() {\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.arc(this.x, this.y, this.radius, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.5)';\n                ctx.fill();\n            }\n        }\n\n        function init() {\n            resize();\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n            particles = [];\n            for (let i = 0; i < 80; i++) particles.push(new Particle());\n            animate();\n        }\n\n        function animate() {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < particles.length; i++) {\n                particles[i].update();\n                particles[i].draw();\n\n                for (let j = i; j < particles.length; j++) {\n                    const dx = particles[i].x - particles[j].x;\n                    const dy = particles[i].y - particles[j].y;\n                    const dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);\n\n                    if (dist < 150) {\n                        ctx.beginPath();\n                        ctx.strokeStyle = `rgba(59, 130, 246, ${0.15 - dist/1000})`;\n                        ctx.lineWidth = 0.5;\n                        ctx.moveTo(particles[i].x, particles[i].y);\n                        ctx.lineTo(particles[j].x, particles[j].y);\n                        ctx.stroke();\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n        }\n        init();\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "neural-architecture-content-section.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/neural-architecture-content-section.jpg", "source_name": "neural-architecture-content-section-DESIGN.md", "views": 122, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T19:33:51.907166+00:00"}